==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The only main threat here is Zory. If you have any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] units such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener]] and [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Welterweight]], this stage will become much easier.

